-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",390,{
[12449]="70044264\n1\tSpeak with Ingold\030Speak with Turgon\tTurgon can be found at the South-gate of the Rammas. Ingold can be found at the North-gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Turgon and Ingold and assist them with protecting the Rammas.\n",
[12450]="7004CE2F\n1\tTalk to Mervárth\tMervárth can be found near the Master's Manor in Lake-town. You should talk to Mervárth.\n2\tFind the Lake-town guards' barracks\tThe guards' barracks can be found near the entrance to Lake-town. You should find the Lake-town guards' barracks.\n3\tTalk to Captain Álarr\tCaptain Álarr can be found inside the guards' barracks in Lake-town. You should talk to Álarr.\n4\tComplete: Taking Notices\030Complete: Clean-up Duty\tCaptain Álarr has agreed to give you access to the location of the murder in return for taking care of some unpleasant work for him. You should complete quests for Captain Álarr.\n5\tTalk to Álarr, The Captain of the Guard\tCaptain Álarr can be found inside the guards' barracks in Lake-town. You should talk to Álarr.\n6\tComplete: The Site of the Murder\tWith access to the location of the murder, you can now begin the investigation into the Master's unexpected demise. You should investigate the murder location with Mervárth.\n7\tTalk to Mervárth\tThe crime scene investigation is complete. You should talk to Mervárth and decide what to do next.\n8\tFind the Trade Commission Headquarters\tThe Trade Commission Headquarters can be found in Lake-town. You should find the Trade Commission Headquarters.\n9\tTalk to Dagrun\tDagrun can be found in the Trade Commission Headquarters. You should talk to Dagrun.\n10\tComplete: The Smugglers' Den\030Complete: Breaking Up the Gang\030Complete: Smuggled Goods\tDagrun can be found in the Trade Commission Headquarters. You should complete quests for Dagrun.\n11\tTalk to Dagrun\tDagrun can be found in the Trade Commission Headquarters. You should talk to Dagrun.\n12\tTalk to Skótmun\tSkótmun can be found in the holding cell in the Trade Commission Headquarters. You should talk to Skótmun.\n13\tTalk to Mervárth\tMervárth can be summoned to your side if you were separated. You should talk to Mervárth.\n",
[12451]="700017AB\n1\tShow the collar to someone at the treasure hunters' camp\tWill Widdup is at the treasure hunters' camp outside of Fornost City, in the northern North Downs. You should speak with Will Widdup.\n",
[12452]="70066DE4\n1\tTalk to Bruidis by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles\tBruidis is by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles.\n2\tCollect scraggly herbs from the nearby beach (total: 4)\030Collect wild-flowers from the isle near Voyage's End (total: 6)\030Collect tree-bark from the large grey tree west of Bruidis (total: 3)\tBruidis sent you to look for herbs, flowers, and tree bark at several different locations throughout the Shield Isles.\n3\tTalk to Bruidis by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles\tBruidis is by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles.\n4\tAdd the herbs to the tub of water by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles\tThe tub of water where Bruidis plans to brew the salve is to the south-east, near the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles.\n5\tAdd the wild-flowers to the tub of water by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles\tThe tub of water where Bruidis plans to brew the salve is to the south-east, near the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles.\n6\tAdd the tree-bark to the tub of water by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles\tThe tub of water where Bruidis plans to brew the salve is to the south-east, near the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles.\n7\tTalk to Rossaran on the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles\tRossaran is on the Wave-hunter where it has run aground in the Shield Isles.\n8\tAdd the fish scales to the tub of water by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles\tThe tub of water where Bruidis plans to brew the salve is to the south-east, near the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles.\n9\tTalk to Bruidis by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles\tBruidis is by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles.\n",
[12453]="70066DE7\n1\tFind Driftwood on the lower level of Halrax\tManadhon told you the man called Driftwood might be found on the lower level of Halrax, on the south-western side of the inlet.\n2\tWait for Driftwood to acknowledge your presence\tThe man called Driftwood is deep in his cups on the lower level of Halrax, on the south-western side of the inlet.\n3\tTalk to Driftwood on the lower level of Halrax\tDriftwood stands suddenly, knocking his chair to the floor.\n4\tTalk to Sigileth in Halrax\tSigileth has joined you in Halrax.\n5\tTalk to Driftwood on the lower level of Halrax\tDriftwood stands on the lower level of Halrax.\n6\tDefeat Corsairs throughout the Shield Isles (total: 10)\tMany Corsairs throughout the Shield Isles support the Heirs of Castamir, and Driftwood has asked you to continue his work of making things difficult for them.\n7\tReturn to Voyage's End and check on your crew\tHaving defeated many supporters of the Heirs of Castamir throughout the Shield Isles, you should return to the Wave-hunter.\n8\tTalk to Driftwood at Voyage's End\tDriftwood stands by the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles.\n",
[12454]="70066DEA\n1\tTalk to Driftwood on the upper level of Halrax\tManadhon told you the man called Driftwood might be found somewhere to the east in Halrax.\n2\tCollect money-purses from Corsairs throughout the Shield Isles (total: 10)\tCorsairs throughout the Shield Isles carry money-purses that Driftwood recovers and donates to Manadhon.\n3\tBring the money-purses to Manadhon on the upper level of Halrax\tDriftwood has directed you to bring the money-purses to Manadhon on the upper level of Halrax.\n4\tReturn to Voyage's End and check on your crew\tHaving satisfied Driftwood's request, you should return to the Wave-hunter.\n5\tTalk to Driftwood at Voyage's End\tDriftwood stands by the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles.\n",
[12455]="70066DE0\n1\tTalk to Yahîm by Elrohir in Bakhjâd\tElladan and Elrohir have saved Yahîm from danger, and he waits to speak with you in Bakhjâd.\n2\tDefeat kergrim among the ruins (total: 6)\030Retrieve Yahîm's sword from the kergrim-infested ruins\tYahîm has asked you to retrieve his sword from the kergrim den where he lost it, and to slay any of the creatures you can.\n3\tBring Yahîm his sword at his home by the water on the eastern side of Mâr Naphra\tYahîm waits for you to return his sword to him near his home by the water on the eastern side of Mâr Naphra.\n4\tTalk to Elladan at Voyage's End\030Talk to Elrohir at Voyage's End\tElladan and Elrohir have returned to the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles.\n",
[12456]="70066DE1\n1\tClear away concealing vegetation (total: 3)\tGalengam has asked you to clear away some of the dense vegetation near his gathered supplies.\n2\tTalk to Galengam outside Halrax\tGalengam is north of Halrax.\n3\tLook at the vendor's goods on the eastern side of the inlet\030Find the vendor on the eastern side of the inlet\030Look at the first vendor's stall as you enter Halrax\030Find the first vendor's stall as you enter Halrax\030Look at the vendor by an intersection in Halrax\030Find the vendor by a major intersection in Halrax\030Look at the vendor near the base of the sloping road in Halrax\030Find the vendor near the base of the sloping road in Halrax\tGalengam has asked you to look at several vendors within Halrax, to assess the level of his competition.\n4\tTalk to Galengam outside Halrax\tGalengam is north of Halrax.\n5\tCollect salamander legs on the Shield Isles (total: 6)\030Collect toad legs on the Shield Isles (total: 6)\tSalamanders and toads can be found east of Halrax in the Shield Isles, and Galengam believes their legs might prove delicious for his customers... or for the crew of the Wave-hunter.\n6\tBring the salamander and toad legs to Galengam at Voyage's End\tGalengam has returned to the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles.\n",
[12457]="70066DE3\n1\tRetrieve Gangur's pick-axe from the coast nearby\030Retrieve Gangur's satchel from the coast nearby\030Collect rock samples from the island where Gangur came ashore (total: 6)\tGangur Farwend has asked you to retrieve the pick-axe and satchel he lost when he fell overboard. Additionally, he wants you to bring him rock samples from the island onto which he washed ashore.\n2\tBring Gangur's satchel, pick-axe, and rock samples to him on the island where he washed ashore\tGangur Farwend waits for you to bring him his items on the island where he washed ashore.\n3\tDefeat worms or drakes in the high places of the island south of Gangur (total: 6)\030Collect corroded rock samples on the island south of Gangur (total: 4)\tGangur asked you to defeat worms and drakes in the high places of an island to the south, and to search their lair for corroded rock samples that might prove interesting to him.\n4\tBring corroded rock samples to Gangur at Voyage's End\tGangur Farwend has returned to the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles and waits for you to bring him the corroded rock samples he requested.\n",
[12458]="70066DDF\n1\tCollect meat from beasts of the Shield Isles (total: 8)\tVarious beasts of the Shield Isles can provide your crew the food necessary to their survival.\n2\tBring the meat you collected to Gimli at the northern tip of Zamarzîr\tGimli is at the northern tip of the island of Zamarzîr.\n3\tTalk to Legolas at the northern tip of Zamarzîr\tLegolas is at the northern tip of Zamarzîr.\n4\tRetrieve meat and arrows from felled birds throughout Zamarzîr (total: 5)\tLegolas has felled a number of birds throughout Zamarzîr, and asked you to retrieve their meat and his arrows.\n5\tBring the birds and arrows to Legolas at Voyage's End\tLegolas intended to return to the Wave-hunter in the Shield Isles.\n6\tTalk to Gimli at Voyage's End\tGimli has returned to the Wave-hunter, in the Shield Isles.\n",
[12459]="70066DE2\n1\tCollect meat from the beetles north of Jeb Khâtel (total: 6)\tMeat from the nearby beetles on the western side of the island may help feed Gwallang the Limlinn.\n2\tBring the beetle-meat to Gwallang the Limlinn in the north-western Shield Isles\tGwallang the Limlinn is on one of the north-western islands of the Shield Isles.\n3\tFind Gwallang the Limlinn among the islands west of Voyage's End\tGwallang the Limlinn flew to the south-east, and you should look for him among the islands to the west of Voyage's End.\n4\tTalk to Gwallang the Limlinn among the islands west of Voyage's End\tGwallang the Limlinn is among the islands west of Voyage's End.\n5\tHelp Gwallang\tThe ground beneath Gwallang has proved unstable!\n6\tFind Gwallang the Limlinn along the coast of Zamarzîr\tGwallang the Limlinn flew to the south-east, and you should look for him along the coast of Zamarzîr.\n7\tTalk to Gwallang the Limlinn along the coast of Zamarzîr\tGwallang the Limlinn is along the coast of Zamarzîr in the Shield Isles.\n",
[12460]="70066DDE\n1\tSigileth asked you to search several of the shipwrecks at Shedax Khîn in search of her brother.\t\n2\tTalk to Sigileth further south of the wrecks you investigated in Shedax Khîn\tSigileth is further south of the wrecks you investigated in Shedax Khîn.\n3\tRead the note Sigileth discovered inside a bottle in one of the wrecks of Shedax Khîn\tSigileth handed you a note she found within a bottle discovered on one of the wrecks in Shedax Khîn.\n4\tTalk to Sigileth south of the wrecks you investigated in Shedax Khîn\tSigileth is south of the wrecks you investigated in Shedax Khîn.\n",
[12461]="70066DDB\n1\tLook towards the island to the west\030Find the western beach of the island to the north-west of Voyage's End\030Look at the beach of the island to the north-west of Voyage's End\030Find the beach of the island to the north-west of Voyage's End\030Look to the south on the beach across the lagoon from Voyage's End\030Find the beach across the lagoon to the south\tSirgon has asked you to look over your surroundings at three separate locations: the beach across the lagoon to the south of Sirgon, the beach to the north-west of the Wave-hunter, and the beach on the western side of the island.\n2\tTalk to Sirgon at Voyage's End\tSirgon is located at Voyage's End on the Shield Isles.\n",
[12462]="70066DDC\n1\tCollect floating barrels (total: 6)\030Collect ship supplies along the coast (total: 4)\tBarrels float in the water not far from the Wave-hunter, and other supplies have fetched up upon the nearby coastline.\n2\tBring the supplies to Daxamat by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles\tDaxamat stands by the Wave-hunter on the Shield Isles.\n",
[12463]="70066DDD\n1\tExamine the posted notice outside Mâr Naphra\tNauriel stands by a posted notice outside Mâr Naphra.\n2\tTalk to Nauriel outside Mâr Naphra\tNauriel stands outside Mâr Naphra, considering the bounty posted on the Kindred of the Coins by the Heirs of Castamir.\n3\tDefeat aggressive residents of Mâr Naphra, and make it noisy (total: 8)\tIf you are to get an audience with Saklaphêl, you will need to attract the attention of the residents of Mâr Naphra.\n4\tWait for someone to notice the ruckus you created\tHave you made enough of a commotion in Mâr Naphra?\n5\tTalk to Galadaith from atop the tall buildings on the western side of Mâr Naphra\tA man called Galadaith has called for you from atop a tall building on the western side of Mâr Naphra.\n6\tTalk to Nauriel outside Mâr Naphra\tNauriel waits for you outside Mâr Naphra.\n",
[12464]="700490FA\n1\tTalk to Lômazar\tLômazar is located at the Ruins of Díngarth. You should speak with Lômazar.\n2\tTalk to Ingold\tYou should talk to Ingold.\n3\tTalk to Ingold\tIngold can be found back at the Ruins of Díngarth. You should talk to Ingold.\n4\tTalk to Hithgol\tHithgol can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth. You should talk to Hithgol.\n",
[12465]="70053E6D\n1\tRetrieve the urn from the hills of eastern Rath Dúath\030Retrieve the urn from outside the barrows of Gorthad Nûr\030Complete: Dwelling in the Hills\tThe urns Rauniel seeks can be found in the hills of eastern Rath Dúath and from outside the barrows of Gorthad Nûr. You should retrieve the urns for Rauniel.\n2\tPour water into a vessel upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur\tVessels for the water of the urns can be found upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur in Rath Dúath. You should pour water into the vessels for Rauniel.\n3\tTalk to Rauniel by the bridge to Eithel Gwaur\tRauniel can be found by the bridge to Eithel Gwaur in Rath Dúath. You should talk to Rauniel.\n",
[12466]="7000002B\n1\tTalk to Jailor Ned Pruner\tNed Pruner is at the jail, north and east of the town-gate. Constable Thistlewool suggested that you may be able to assist Ned Pruner to discover what Calder Cob told the Blackwold brigands.\n",
[12467]="7004D092\n1\tYou should talk to Easterling refugees in Dale and learn the truth of the rumours.\t\n2\tDefeat Jangovar in the Dale-lands (total: 6)\030Search for the missing refugees\tYou should look for sign of the missing refugees, south from Dale's eastern gates, and defeat any Jangovar that may have been involved in their disappearance.\n3\tDefeat Jangovar at Tay Yoldash (total: 7)\030Free refugees in Tay Yoldash (total: 6)\tTay Yoldash can be found south-east of the city of Dale in the Dale-lands. You should defeat Jangovar and free refugees from Tay Yoldash.\n4\tReturn to Orphón\tYou should return to Orphón with news of your success, just outside Tay Yoldash.\n",
[12468]="7000DFF2\n1\tTalk to Esko in Pynti-peldot\tEsko is in Pynti-peldot, just south of the great bay. Menikko has asked you to speak with a man named Esko to learn the story of the lost Lossoth treasure.\n",
[12469]="70057186\n1\tDefeat Orcs and Wargs in the Floodfells (total: 10)\tLéothred has asked you to defeat Orcs and Wargs in the Floodfells. You should defeat Orcs and Wargs in the Floodfells.\n2\tVisit the White Mare in the Floodfells\tThe White Mare can be found in the Floodfells. You should visit the White Mare.\n3\tTalk to Léothred at the White Mare\tLéothred can be found at the White Mare. You should talk to Léothred.\n",
[12470]="70057E61\n1\tTalk to Léothred on the path towards Ered Mithrin\tLéothred can be found in Misthallow on the path towards Ered Mithrin. You should talk to Léothred on the path towards Ered Mithrin.\n2\tGather meats for the journey to Erebor (total: 6)\tGame meat can be found in the nearby hills on the path to Ered Mithrin from Misthallow. You should collect meats from moose and Anduin hunters for the journey to Erebor.\n3\tBring the meats to Léothred\tLéothred can be found in Misthallow on the path towards Ered Mithrin. You should bring the meats to Léothred.\n4\tTalk to Léothred at Erebor\tLéothred can be found at the gates of Erebor. You should talk to Léothred at Erebor.\n",
[12471]="70037793\n1\tHelp Agelwyn and her people reach Helm's Deep\tAgelwyn is in the ravine north of Marton. You should speak with Agelwyn.\n2\tSpeak with Gamling\tGamling is at Helm's Dike in the south-western Westfold. You should speak with Gamling.\n",
[12472]="700559A6\n1\tDefeat Shorábakh\tShorábakh can be found at Meremband upon the Circle of Death. You should defeat Shorábakh.\n2\tDefeat Shorábakh\tShorábakh can be found at Meremband upon the Circle of Death. You should defeat Shorábakh.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated Shorábakh.\n",
[12473]="700011CB\n1\tDefeat Garthamendir\tGarthamendir guards the gates of Carn Dûm to the west. Areneth warned you of the Cargûl and its terrible wrath. But killing the fell creature is the only way to break the Angmarim forces. He warned you not to face Garthamendir alone.\n2\tTalk to Areneth\tAreneth is at Gath Forthnír, east of Carn Dûm. Garthamendir was defeated and his forces shattered. You should return to Areneth with the news.\n",
[12474]="70036B1A\n1\tSpeak to Arnar to choose a race contestant\tSpeak to Arnar and choose your favourite contestant for the next upcoming race.\n2\tObserve the race and cheer for your chosen participant.\t\n",
[12475]="7000A8F9\n1\tDefeat kergrim in Haudh Valandil (total: 20)\030Defeat Shingrinder\tKergrim stalk Haudh Valandil, the tomb on the island beyond the bridge of Ariant, in Annúminas. Glangilith has asked you to defeat the kergrim that stalk the depths of Haudh Valandil, including their leader Shingrinder.\n",
[12476]="7004CE23\n1\tFind someone in Othrikar who knows about the Secret Stone\tYou found a note in Moria pointing you towards Othrikar. You should find someone who knows something about the Secret Stone in Othrikar.\n2\tDiscover whom to ask for in Othrikar.\tYou found a dwarf in Othrikar who knows about the Secret Stone, but he cannot help you unless you know whom to ask for. You should discover whom to ask for in Othrikar.\n3\tTalk to Lúki\tYou have discovered the name of the dwarf in Othrikar. You should ask for Rúnvarth.\n4\tTalk to Rúnvarth\tRúnvarth can be found in Othrikar. You should talk to Rúnvarth.\n5\tRúnvarth has told you that he needs three items from you. You should discover what these items are.\t\n6\tTalk to Rúnvarth\tRúnvarth can be found in Othrikar. You should talk to Rúnvarth.\n7\tFind the keyhole\tNow that you have the key, you must find the keyhole. You should find the keyhole.\n8\tYou have found the Secret Stone inside Erebor! You should claim the Secret Stone!\t\n9\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found in Erebor. You should bring the Secret Stone to King Thorin.\n",
[12477]="70049628\n1\tCollect keys from jailers in Naerband\tNaerband is located in Talath Úrui. You should collect keys from jailers in Naerband.\n2\tCollect keys from jailers in Naerband (total: 12)\tNaerband is located in Talath Úrui. You should collect keys from jailers in Naerband.\n3\tOpen prison doors (total: 12)\tNaerband is located in Talath Úrui. You should free prisoners in Naerband.\n4\tCompleted\tAttempted to free many prisoners in Naerband.\n",
[12478]="70027F0A\n1\tDefeat Lûnt the Overseer and take his key\tLûnt the Overseer can be found in the Orc-mines. Edhere asked you to defeat Lûnt the Overseer and retrieve the cell-key he carries.\n2\tBring the overseer's key to Edhere in the Orc-mines\tEdhere is in the Orc-mines. You should bring the overseer's key to Edhere.\n",
[12479]="7000ED95\n1\tTake a key from a Dourhand within the ancient Icereave Mines\tThe Icereave Mines lie to the south-west of Zigilgund. Thórth has asked you to drive the Dourhands from the Icereave Mines.\n2\tBring the key to Thórth\030Take a key from a Dourhand within the Icereave Mines\tThórth is at Zigilgund. You should return to Thórth with news of your victory.\n",
[12480]="7005AA32\n1\t(Optional) Report to a Mission Recruiter\t\n2\t(Optional) Report to a Mission Recruiter\030Travel to Akrâz-zahar in Erebor\tYou are to report to Akrâz-zahar, in Erebor. Mission Recruiters are available to deliver you there with haste. Mission Recruiters can be found at Thorin's Gate, Gondamon, Bree-town, The Twenty-first Hall, Othrikar, Gabilshathûr, Glóin's Camp, Hrimbarg, Galtrev, The Dolven-view, Magh Ashtu, Járnfast, Erebor, and Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\n3\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar\tVorthur Smokebreath can be found at Akrâz-zahar, in Erebor. At the behest of King Thorin Stonehelm, the Kharum-ubnâr have enlisted the aid of skilled adventurers to secure distant dwarf-holds and ensure the success of Prince Durin and the Gabil'akkâ in the forthcoming reclamation of Mount Gundabad.\n",
})
